 <span style=3D"font-size: 24.0px;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: -0.01=
em;">Systems in scope&nbsp;</span>
</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7650f2b0-98f7-48e5-b3f8-120d2bfa5fef">R2 (Compass legacy)=
</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a656dcf9-ea7a-44ad-be47-06056a996779">Secure Zone</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"31197393-aa84-4703-84dd-5b3365e93e6f">NetRep</li>
