   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1. Multi-parents</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Multi=E2=80=91parent access ranges show substantial variation among=
 users,&nbsp;
      <br>
      with MAX 31, MIN 2, AVG 38, and MED 37.</p>
     <p>Parent counts are calculated as distinct parent IDs assigned to eac=
h user.&nbsp;
      <br>
      Parents are only assigned for active client firm ID, so only these us=
ers are included in the parent=E2=80=91count distribution.</p>
     <p>Although internal employees were filtered out using the internal em=
ployee list, it is still difficult to guarantee that all internal users hav=
e been fully excluded.</p>
     <p>
      <br>
     </p>
    </td>
