    <span>=20
     <br>=20
    </span><span>=20
     <br>3. The pattern observed for <strong>ICPMB_HIVFG</strong> cannot be=
 generalized across all firms. For example, despite having Sub_Advisor_Firm=
_IDs, the user <strong>Martin Lalonde </strong>has a user ID only under <st=
rong>QCPM_RIVEM</strong>, with no corresponding user ID created under the s=
ub-advisor firm. The same approach is also observed in NetRep.=20
